OL,3,AIsraeli exit polls suggest no clear
OL,4,Awinner with Eisenkot's bloc neck and
OL,5,Aneck with Netanyahu
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsrael's election result is too close
OL,8,Fto call, with Gadi Eisenkot's bloc neck
OL,9,Fand neck with Benjamin Natanyahu's camp
OL,10,Fin two exit polls; a third puts the
OL,11,FPM's camp marginally ahead - both have
OL,12,Ffallen short of a majority
OL,14,FEisenkot leads the newly formed Yashar
OL,15,Fparty and is the main figure in the
OL,16,F"change bloc", a group of opposition
OL,17,Fparties with the shared goal of ousting
OL,18,FNetanyahu
OL,20,FThe exit polls also suggest Netanyahu's
OL,21,FLikud party is set to be the biggest
OL,22,Fsingle party in the Israeli parliament
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
