OL,3,AIsraeli exit polls suggest no clear
OL,4,Awinner with Eisenkot's bloc neck and
OL,5,Aneck with Netanyahu
OL,6,
OL,7,FNetanyahu says a "strong" right-wing
OL,8,Fgovernment must be formed, while
OL,9,FEisenkot tells supporters that Israel
OL,10,Fvoted to end Netanyahu's term
OL,12,FOfficial results started being released
OL,13,Ffrom midnight local time (22:00 GMT),
OL,14,Fbut counting could take days
OL,16,FAll 120 seats in the Knesset, Israel's
OL,17,Fparliament, are up for grabs, but no
OL,18,Fparty has ever won a majority and in
OL,19,Fthe past governments have been made up
OL,20,Fof coalitions
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
